#QLCIR-G1
# name: demorgan_channels_k4_d5_rev
# family: physics/complemented-channels
# expected: UNSAT
# physical: Logical relation between a coarse detector event and the event that none of its constituent channels occurs.
# note: One-sided difference test for De Morgan equivalence between exclusion of a 4-channel coarse event and simultaneous exclusion of every channel.
dim(5)
output(9)
1 = or(ch0, ch1, ch2, ch3)
2 = not(1)
3 = not(ch0)
4 = not(ch1)
5 = not(ch2)
6 = not(ch3)
7 = and(3, 4, 5, 6)
8 = not(2)
9 = and(7, 8)
